# Deprecated/Legacy Marker Allowlist
# Each entry: file:line — reason — removal condition
# Format: <file_pattern>:<marker> | <reason> | <removal_condition>

# Backward-compat serde aliases (must keep until config schema migration)
config/compaction.rs:char_threshold | serde alias for old config files | remove after config migration
config/types.rs:char_threshold | serde alias for old config files | remove after config migration

# Backward-compat dispatch (must keep for request_reauth)
tool/dispatch.rs:route_to | request_reauth fakes route_to operation | replace with explicit reauth operation
tool/dispatch.rs:handle_route_to | validates route_to from request_reauth | remove with above

# Pipeline backward-compat (must keep for old runtime.json files)
pipeline/mod.rs:route_to | load_from migration alias | remove after one release
pipeline/schema.rs:route_to | validation accepts old action name | remove after one release

# Backward-compat playbook aliases (must keep for validation subsystem)
playbook/mod.rs:compat_playbook_for_event | legacy event name aliases | add WatchdogEvent variants, then remove

# Learning store migration (must keep for existing projects with legacy soul files)
learning/store.rs:legacy_neige_paths | migration path for old soul files | remove after project schema version bump

# Audit line compat (must keep for old events.jsonl)
audit/document_line/events.rs:legacy | maps old run_id on load | remove after projects re-scan events
